@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 2NDHAND - target Order states (scope 1 Oct 2026)
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9

[*] --> WAITING_PAYMENT : create/reserve
WAITING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED : unpaid cancel / 30-minute expiry
WAITING_PAYMENT --> WAITING_SELLER_SHIP : persisted payment / HELD
WAITING_SELLER_SHIP --> REFUNDED : paid_at+72h / no timely shipment
WAITING_SELLER_SHIP --> SHIPPING_TO_CENTER : validated frozen return address / timely ship
SHIPPING_TO_CENTER --> RECEIVED_AT_CENTER : canonical Inspector receive
RECEIVED_AT_CENTER --> INSPECTING : assigned work
INSPECTING --> RESULT_NOTIFIED : final result + qualifying certificate atomic
RESULT_NOTIFIED --> SHIPPING_TO_BUYER : PASS/MINOR_ISSUE + Buyer CONFIRM / final leg
RESULT_NOTIFIED --> RETURNED_TO_SELLER : REJECT or negative / TO_SELLER confirmed proof
SHIPPING_TO_BUYER --> DELIVERED_PENDING_BUYER : assigned Courier confirms readable proof
DELIVERED_PENDING_BUYER --> COMPLETED : Buyer receipt OR eligible AUTO / one RELEASE
DELIVERED_PENDING_BUYER --> DELIVERY_DISPUTED : report before deadline / HELD
DELIVERY_DISPUTED --> COMPLETED : audited Admin evidence / RELEASE
DELIVERY_DISPUTED --> REFUNDED : audited Admin evidence / full REFUND
RETURNED_TO_SELLER --> REFUNDED : durable retry / full held-total REFUND
CANCELLED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]
REFUNDED --> [*]

note right of RESULT_NOTIFIED
  During return transit Order remains RESULT_NOTIFIED.
  Shipment holds TO_SELLER IN_TRANSIT, not an extra Order state.
  Negative results have no CONFIRM or certificate.
  No automatic inspection decision.
end note
note right of DELIVERED_PENDING_BUYER
  Deadline = confirmed readable TO_BUYER proof + 72h.
  Fresh DB clock after lock and I/O revalidation governs writes.
  Timely report blocks AUTO; outage/unreadable proof leaves HELD.
end note
note right of RETURNED_TO_SELLER
  Delivery commits before refund attempt.
  Failure preserves proof and HELD for scheduled retry.
end note
note bottom of REFUNDED
  Full original held total; original Payment/Receipt unchanged.
  Product CANCELLED, no automatic relisting.
end note
legend bottom
  Target submission behavior; current baseline still needs FINISH.
  COMPLETED permits one seller review; refund does not.
  Inspection overdue escalates without inventing transitions.
endlegend
@enduml
